WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.800
On Parent Home, tap Change beside Active Player.

00:01.800 --> 00:03.667
Choose the row for the player and team you want.

00:03.667 --> 00:05.733
The selected player and team now appear under Active Player.

00:05.733 --> 00:07.600
Tap Change again to see the player and team choices.

00:07.600 --> 00:09.600
The same player can be selected under a different team.

00:09.600 --> 00:11.533
Choose another player's row to switch players.

00:11.533 --> 00:13.333
Check the player and team shown under Active Player.

00:13.333 --> 00:15.133
Repeat Change and choose a row whenever you need to switch.

00:15.133 --> 00:18.367
Check Active Player to confirm your selection. Names and teams have been anonymised.
